{
  "slug": "luciq",
  "name": "Luciq",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Luciq mobile observability: Investigate crashes, trace production signals to source code, integrate the Luciq SDK, and handle version migrations.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `luciq-debug` (Use when the user wants to investigate a Luciq production signal end to end, propose a code fix,…), `luciq-migrate` (Use when the user asks to migrate a mobile codebase from the legacy Instabug SDK to Luciq, upgrade…), `luciq-setup` (Use when the user asks to add, install, set up, integrate, or initialize the Luciq mobile observability SDK…), `luciq-verify` (Verify a Luciq SDK upgrade end to end before shipping)\n- **Commands** (1): `luciq-verify` (Verify a Luciq SDK upgrade end to end before shipping (invokes the luciq-verify skill))\n- **MCP servers** (1): `luciq`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install luciq@claude-community` from `luciqai/agent-skills` (`plugins/luciq-skills`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
